{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3452","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3452/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3452/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3452/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit/issues/3452","id":3670589992,"node_id":"I_kwDOAJbtsc7ayMIo","number":3452,"title":"Sleeping thread prevents test runner from exiting","user":{"login":"marcOcram","id":784604,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NDYwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/784604?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram","html_url":"https://github.com/marcOcram","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcOcram/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":75574707,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3NTU3NDcwNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"FEF2C0","default":false,"description":"A fault in an existing feature"},{"id":241290899,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDEyOTA4OTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Core%20framework","name":"Core framework","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"xunit.v3.core"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-11-27T09:29:57Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T03:47:40Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Yesterday I stumbled upon an issue with our tests not finishing. I hunted it down to the fact, that, as long as a non-background thread is running, the test runner does not stop. Here is a minimal repro test. Maybe this is similar to #3447.\n\n```csharp\n[Fact]\npublic void Test()\n{\n    // arrange\n    using ManualResetEventSlim waiter = new ManualResetEventSlim();\n\n    // act\n    Thread thread = new Thread(() => {\n        waiter.Set(); // thread started\n        Thread.Sleep(Timeout.Infinite); // pretend to do a serious amount of work\n    });\n    //thread.IsBackground = true; // this workarounds the issue\n    thread.Start();\n\n    // wait for thread started\n    waiter.Wait(TestContext.Current.CancellationToken);\n\n    // assert\n}\n```\n\nI am using xunit.v3 in version 3.2.0 with the runner in version 3.1.5.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3452/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}